# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF line endings, on every OS and for every tool
# (Windows checkouts, Codex and Claude edits alike), so edits never mix CRLF and LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
